install <ship> <item>
install <planet>p <item>

    Install allows you to install a "big" item such as an engine or computer
into one of the ship's active use slots, if any are free. The item must
already be loaded onto the ship. While an item is installed it's efficiency
will be maintained, but it's tech level slowly drops.

    Weapons (blasers and photon torpedo tubes) can also be installed on a
planet you own, so the planet can fire them. Give the planet as its number
followed by "p", for example "install 12p 345". The weapon must be on that
planet. A planet can have up to 8 weapons installed.

See also:
        LOAD, REMOVE, SHIPS, UNLOAD, FIRE
